# Audit correction outcome — 2026-11-17

Status: bounded corrections independently reviewed and validated. AC-01–04 of
this manual supplement are APPROVED; see review.md and validation.md. This is a bounded audit correction, not global
product or native visual acceptance. The supplied audit is partially substantiated.

All 151 numbered findings have dispositions in [assessment.md](assessment.md).
The implementation records are [governance](governance.md), [visual](visual.md)
and [source-grounded documentation](root-docs.md). Their earlier observed hashes
