  criteria. Three stale APPROVED states became UNVERIFIED; no state promoted.
- Corrected two traceability mappings and clarified absent current Opengrep and
  Cargo-parity evidence. The initial 28-envelope repair was followed by two
  reason-only envelope changes. Historical artifact/input hashes were not renewed.
- Reconciled first-use labels, settings/sidebar documentation, actual trust
  boundaries,43-feature index, retention, wrapper-versus-runner defaults,
  current scope and historical record navigation.
- Applied 17 independently reviewed skill corrections after host escalation:
  consumer-policy precedence, provenance limits, optional-capability references,
  commit verification scope, Iced accessibility limits and a parser-output typo.
- Corrected native input styling, focus contrast, pressed state, unreachable
  Settings branches, demo diff values and signature dimensions. Independent review
  caught selection disappearing under focus and missing disabled styling; both
  are repaired with regression coverage. Source geometry is not native proof.
- Recorded dependency-bundled fonts and local third-party notices without claiming
  that unresolved rights or product distribution readiness are settled.

