## Residual limits and non-adopted proposals

Fresh native keyboard/layout/scaling and same-theme VS Enterprise parity were not
observed; Iced assistive-technology semantics remain unimplemented. SVG text/XML
were checked but the historical Mermaid/Playwright installation is unavailable,
so current text fit was not re-rendered. Generic panel radii, ungenerated scales
and duplicate unadopted direction-B metadata remain explicit design work.

Constitutional future/pending wording, broader traceability debt and historical
criterion succession need their own precise authority/input reconciliation;
this correction does not waive those gates. Historical ignored logs and missing
/tmp recovery cannot establish clean-clone reproducibility. No indiscriminate log
publication, history deletion, source-book claims, RustSec expiry extension or
new dependency acquisition was performed. RustSec expiry remains a real data
constraint, not an excuse to change its timestamp. No full scanner run, commit
or publication occurred.

Documentation disposition: reviewed/updated the paths in the three contribution
reports, the manual spec/plan/tasks/assessment here and authenticated succession
surfaces. Current instructions and examples were reconciled against actual source;
older observations remain dated. Feature states remain undecided where current
